Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 13
Set Width 1440
Set Height 900
Set Theme "OneDark"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Type "poplar"
Enter
Sleep 4s

Type "c"
Sleep 1s

Type "geoff@907.life,"
Sleep 500ms

Tab
Sleep 300ms
Tab
Sleep 300ms
Tab
Sleep 300ms

Type "Welcome to poplar"
Sleep 300ms

Tab
Sleep 400ms

Type "Poplar is a bubbletea terminal email client with first-class markdown support."
Sleep 200ms
Enter
Enter
Type "Highlights:"
Enter
Type "- threaded conversations"
Enter
Type "- CardDAV contacts"
Enter
Type "- outbox plus undo send"
Sleep 2s

